    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Automated</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">@automated @functional @android</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">When the user taps the &quot;New box&quot; button | And the user enters box name &quot;Garage Tools&quot; and leaves optional fields blank | And the user taps the Create Box button | Then the box &quot;Garage Tools&quot; should appear in the stash list</Data></Cell>
